ValueSet: TWCMICD11Disease
Id: twcm-icd11-disease
Title: "ICD-11中醫病名"
Description: "中醫病名值集。內容為ICD-11第26章「傳統醫學病證」Module I中之病名分類(Traditional medicine disorders (TM1))，代碼與名稱引用自WHO官方ICD-11 MMS(Mortality and Morbidity Statistics)，網址為[http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/mms](http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/mms)。"
* ^status = #active
* ^experimental = false
